\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Project: RetroPortal \'97 A Dark-Mode iGoogle-Inspired Browser Homepage\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 1. Project Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 You are an experienced full-stack web developer, UI/UX designer, and browser-extension developer.\
I want you to design, build, test, and document a complete, production-ready personalised browser homepage inspired by 
\f0\b iGoogle from approximately 2005\'962009
\f1\b0 .\
The application should faithfully recreate the nostalgic appearance of mid-2000s Web 2.0 dashboards, but with dark-mode styling, modern performance, and comprehensive customisation.\
