\f0\b \cf0 Option A: GitHub Pages
\f1\b0 \
The entire application must run as a static website.\
Support a deployment URL similar to:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 https://USERNAME.github.io/retroportal/
\f1\fs24 \
Use Vite's appropriate base-path configuration, relative asset handling, and GitHub Actions for automated deployment.\
Do not require a traditional backend or paid hosting service.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Option B: Browser extension
\f1\b0 \
Create a Manifest V3 extension that replaces the default new-tab page.\
Prefer packaging the built application locally inside the extension so that the interface loads reliably and quickly.\
The extension must not rely on injecting scripts into an externally hosted website.\
Allow users to choose between:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
