\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Optional hosted homepage mode, where the extension opens or redirects to the GitHub Pages URL\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Document the practical differences between these modes, including offline availability and update behaviour.\
Avoid unnecessary browser permissions.\
Ensure extension scripts comply with Manifest V3 Content Security Policy requirements.\
Firefox compatibility is desirable, but Chrome and other Chromium-based browsers are the primary targets.\
